OL,3,GNEWSABody recovered from water near
OL,4,APortpatrick
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a man has been recovered
OL,7,Ffrom the water near Portpatrick
OL,8,Ffollowing reports of a person in the
OL,9,Fwater.
OL,11,FPolice, coastguard rescues crews and a
OL,12,Fcoastguard helicopter were deployed
OL,13,Fafter emergency services were alerted
OL,14,Fat about 07:15 on Sunday morning.
OL,16,FPolice said the death is being treated
OL,17,Fas unexplained and inquiries are
OL,18,Fongoing.
OL,20,FThey added that a report will be
OL,21,Fsubmitted to the procurator fiscal.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
